{"id":"e9bbbe4420f54ce9","group":"91","path":"91/91-cor-gap-implies-stable.md","title":"极小固定点中确定的句子在所有一致固定点同值","display":"cor-gap-implies-stable — 极小固定点中确定的句子在所有一致固定点同值","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-cor-gap-implies-stable","aliases":["91-cor-gap-implies-stable","91-cor-gap-stability","91-cor-gap-sentence-property"],"display":"cor-gap-implies-stable — 极小固定点中确定的句子在所有一致固定点同值","depends_on":["[[91-df-stable-sentence]]","[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","[[91-df-truth-value-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-cor-gap-implies-stable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-cor-gap-implies-stable</span><span>91-cor-gap-stability</span><span>91-cor-gap-sentence-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-gap-implies-stable — 极小固定点中确定的句子在所有一致固定点同值"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3a19d5715745463a\" href=\"?note=3a19d5715745463a\" title=\"91-df-stable-sentence\">91-df-stable-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"460308c7099a8386\" href=\"?note=460308c7099a8386\" title=\"91-df-minimal-fixed-point\">91-df-minimal-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2bc1263010e83604\" href=\"?note=2bc1263010e83604\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-function\">91-df-truth-value-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\min}\">\\(X_{\\min}\\)</span> 为所给 J 的极小固定点，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\">\\(\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\)</span> 为一致固定点类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_X\">\\(v_X\\)</span> 为固定点评估。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Stable}_J\">\\(\\operatorname{Stable}_J\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3a19d5715745463a\" href=\"?note=3a19d5715745463a\" title=\"91-df-stable-sentence\">91-df-stable-sentence</a> 的全固定点同值约定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}gap\\text{-}implies\\text{-}stable}\\vdash\\quad\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X_{\\min}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Stable}_J(\\varphi)\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\;v_X(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}gap\\text{-}implies\\text{-}stable}\\vdash\\quad\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X_{\\min}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Stable}_J(\\varphi)\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\;v_X(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X_{\\min}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Stable}_J(\\varphi)\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\;v_X(\\varphi)=\\mathbf f.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X_{\\min}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Stable}_J(\\varphi)\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\;v_X(\\varphi)=\\mathbf f.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>极小性给代码包含，固定点读码给相应真/假值。删去没有用于此证明的 gap/glut 对偶依赖。\n文件历史名称中的 gap 不表示“极小点有间隙就稳定”。直接真理陈述者在极小点有间隙，却可在其他一致点真或假；稳定间隙如说谎者需要另一个证明。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemmas 15.7、15.13–15.14；本地全固定点稳定性的直接推论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-stable-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"3a19d5715745463a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-stable-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"460308c7099a8386","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-value-function","status":"resolved","id":"2bc1263010e83604","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-value-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-stable-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"3a19d5715745463a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Stable}_J$ 采用 [[91-df-stable-sentence]] 的全固定点同值约定。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X_{\\min}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)","display":false},{"tex":"v_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Stable}_J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}gap\\text{-}implies\\text{-}stable}\\vdash\\quad\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X_{\\min}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Stable}_J(\\varphi)\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\;v_X(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t.","display":true},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X_{\\min}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Stable}_J(\\varphi)\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\;v_X(\\varphi)=\\mathbf f.","display":true}],"bytes":1601,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-197","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-cor-gap-implies-stable]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-197","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-cor-gap-implies-stable]]"}],"outgoing":["3a19d5715745463a","460308c7099a8386","2bc1263010e83604"]}